Five valid samples/pairs;log loss 0.88,neighbor loss 0.60,invalid prediction gradient 0.
\image(figures/monocular_depth_neighbors.svg)
// result_end
\caption(The valid sensor mask distinguishes a missing target from a true zero residual. Only pairs with two valid endpoints contribute;native independent oracles verify every masked/log/neighbor derivative and empty-support case.)
